{"id": "12", "model": "eleven_v4", "lines": [{"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "That night, nobody went to bed at eleven. [pause] Not even Mom."}, {"speaker": "MOM", "text": "[sleepy] Five more minutes..."}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[sleepy, smiling] Same time next week, champ?"}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[softly] Same time, Dad. [pause] Every week."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "And the next Saturday... YOU called the family meeting."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[cheerful] Family Game Night! [pause] Same server! Same time!"}, {"speaker": "GRANDMA", "text": "[sweetly] And don't forget your rent, dear."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Dad still can't do a double jump. [pause] Mom started a training class. [pause] DarkBlade signed up first."}, {"speaker": "DARKBLADE", "text": "[shy] Thank you, Mrs. Mom."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "And Granny bought the Block King's castle. [pause] It's a cookie museum now. [pause] Tickets are ten coins."}, {"speaker": "SYSTEM", "text": "[cheerful] DarkBlade's mom joined the server."}, {"speaker": "DARKBLADE", "text": "[horrified] ...MOM?!"}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "[warmly] So... if YOUR parents joined your server, who would be the noob? [pause] Tell me in the comments!"}], "voice_segments": [{"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 0.0, "end_time_seconds": 4.68, "character_start_index": 0, "character_end_index": 63, "dialogue_input_index": 0}, {"voice_id": "XrExE9yKIg1WjnnlVkGX", "start_time_seconds": 4.68, "end_time_seconds": 6.96, "character_start_index": 63, "character_end_index": 92, "dialogue_input_index": 1}, {"voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal", "start_time_seconds": 6.96, "end_time_seconds": 9.36, "character_start_index": 92, "character_end_index": 137, "dialogue_input_index": 2}, {"voice_id": "TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ", "start_time_seconds": 9.36, "end_time_seconds": 12.4, "character_start_index": 137, "character_end_index": 181, "dialogue_input_index": 3}, {"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6